38
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:12,370
What do you mean?

39
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:13,330
What happened?

40
00:02:14,130 --> 00:02:18,390
There are many factors that weigh in, but NASDAQ is down 200 points.

41
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:21,720
The Dow Jones indicator also suffered.

42
